    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present 19 Palmer Park to the market. This attractive three-bedroom home is ideally positioned within the mature and well-established Palmer Park development, enjoying a pleasant outlook and a spacious west-facing rear garden.\n\nOffering well-proportioned accommodation throughout, the property provides an excellent opportunity for those looking to put their own stamp on a home in a highly sought-after South Dublin location. The property has considerable potential to extend, subject to the necessary planning permission, with the generous rear garden and attached garage offering scope for future enhancement.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, living room, kitchen and recently upgraded bathroom at ground floor level. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, including two double bedrooms and a single bedroom, together with access to the attic.\n\nOutside, the property benefits from ample parking to the front, while the spacious west-facing rear garden is a particular feature. Offering excellent afternoon and evening sunshine, the garden provides plenty of room for outdoor entertaining, family use or future extension, subject to planning permission. The attached garage also provides valuable additional storage and offers further potential for adaptation or extension, subject to the necessary permissions.\n\nPalmer Park is a mature residential development situated in the Rathfarnham/Ballyboden area, providing a peaceful setting while remaining within easy reach of an excellent range of amenities. The established nature of the development, together with its proximity to green spaces, schools, shopping facilities and transport links, makes it an appealing location for a variety of buyers.\nRathfarnham Village is close by, offering a wide selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and local services. Rathfarnham Shopping Centre and Nutgrove Shopping Centre are also within easy reach, providing a convenient range of everyday shopping and services. Dundrum Town Centre is a short distance away, offering an extensive choice of retail, dining and leisure facilities. \n\nFor those who enjoy the outdoors, the property is well positioned for access to some of South Dublin's best-known parks and recreational areas. Marlay Park is nearby, with its extensive parkland, walking routes and sporting facilities, while St. Enda's Park and Rathfarnham Castle Park provide further opportunities for recreation and leisure.\nThe area is also well served by a selection of established primary and secondary schools, making the location particularly convenient for families. Schools in the wider area include Rathfarnham Parish National School, St Mary's Boys National School and Gaelcholáiste An Phiarsaigh, with a number of other well-regarded schools accessible throughout Rathfarnham and the surrounding areas. \nThere are excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre and surrounding employment hubs. The area is well served by Dublin Bus routes, while the M50 is within easy reach, providing convenient access north and south of the city, as well as to Sandyford, Leopardstown and Dublin Airport. \n\nOverall, 19 Palmer Park represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom home in a mature and established development, with generous outdoor space and significant potential for future enhancement. The combination of its well-proportioned accommodation, west-facing garden, attached garage, off-street parking and convenient location makes it a property that will appeal to a broad range of buyers, including first-time buyers, families, investors and those looking to downsize while retaining valuable outdoor space."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.69m x 3.43m\nWelcoming entrance hall with solid wood flooring, dado rail and alarm point. The hall provides access to the kitchen, living room, main bathroom & attatched garage.\n\nLiving Room - 4.05m x 3.64m\nBright and comfortable living room featuring solid wood flooring, a gas fireplace, TV point and feature lighting.\n\nKitchen - 2.31m x 3.64m\nFully fitted kitchen with tiled flooring and attractive wood-panelled ceiling. The kitchen is well equipped with an integrated gas hob and electric oven, with ample storage and preparation space.\n\nShower Room - 1.63m x 1.74m\nUpgraded main bathroom with porclean tiled walls and flooring. The bathroom comprises a new electric shower, WC, wash hand basin and heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.66m x 4.56m\nSpacious double bedroom positioned to the front of the property, featuring fitted wardrobes and excellent proportions.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.71m x 3.05m\nDouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes and carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.79m x 2.33m\nSingle bedroom positioned to the rear of the property, featuring fitted wardrobes and built-in dressers.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
